WEBVTT

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:35.908
(Applause)

00:16:36.258 --> 00:16:37.416
Thank you.

00:16:37.815 --> 00:16:42.523
So Steve Jobs had always believed
in simplicity and elegance and beauty.

00:16:42.547 --> 00:16:44.444
And the truth is,

00:16:44.468 --> 00:16:46.596
for years I was a little depressed,

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.893
because Americans
obviously did not value it,

00:16:48.917 --> 00:16:51.194
because the Mac had
three percent market share,

00:16:51.218 --> 00:16:53.075
Windows had 95 percent market share --

00:16:53.099 --> 00:16:55.976
people did not think it was worth
putting a price on it.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.791
So I was a little depressed.

00:16:57.815 --> 00:16:59.372
And then I heard Al Gore's talk,

00:16:59.396 --> 00:17:01.935
and I realized I didn't know
the meaning of depressed.